File naming here: `arena-<samplerate>-left.wav` is the SADIE II
`azi_30,0_ele_0,0` measurement (source 30° to the LEFT of centre — SADIE II
azimuths are counter-clockwise), `arena-<samplerate>-right.wav` is
`azi_330,0_ele_0,0` (30° to the right). Each file is a stereo HRIR:
channel 0 = left ear, channel 1 = right ear.
